WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:04.051
The micro:bit runs blocks in order, from top to bottom.

2
00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:08.930
Blocks in on start run once, so the last picture stays on.

3
00:00:09.882 --> 00:00:14.532
Blocks in forever run again and again. That loop makes an animation.

4
00:00:17.141 --> 00:00:22.291
pause keeps a picture on for longer. A thousand milliseconds is one second.
